## S7 interface OFF (the default): negotiation proves the object absent before any mutation, so the daemon selects
## the configured stock shortcuts; the NON-EMITTING sink only records them
> window org.kde.kdenlive keypad-generated
  (profile kdenlive for org.kde.kdenlive)
  [kdenlive] org.kde.kdenlive-3451785: org.kde.kdenlive.ControlSurface1 not available (org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.UnknownObject); stock shortcuts will be used
> await absent 8000
  EXPECT ok: interface absent (stock Kdenlive)
## key1 = mark_in (stock "i"), knob1 = jog (stock left/right), key13 = page cycle (daemon mode only), key2 = mark_out ("o")
> key1
  -> key I
> knob1 +2
  -> key RIGHT
  -> key RIGHT
> knob1 -1
  -> key LEFT
> key13
  (Page: timeline)
> key2
  -> key O
> expect keys I RIGHT RIGHT LEFT O
  EXPECT ok: recorded (never emitted) keys I RIGHT RIGHT LEFT O, wanted I RIGHT RIGHT LEFT O
> expect no-refusal
  EXPECT ok: no refusal (none)
